  "description": "TOLQEU crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C98 H94 Dy8 N10 O52,6(C2 H3 N1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.522-3.999 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.14-116.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy8(HL2)6(μ3-OH)4(μ2-OH)2(NO3)4(OCH3)2(H2O)2]·6CH3CN·H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
